  "title": "Software Update: July 2026 Adds Remote Grid Code and Export Limit Controls",
  "summary": "The latest Energy Intelligence software release gives installers and system owners more options for remotely managing Tigo inverter and battery systems.Tigo has released the July 2026 update for the Energy Intelligence (EI) Platform, adding new remote system settings and improvements across the EI Portal and EI Mobile App.The release introduces the ability to remotely configure grid codes and AC export limits. These capabilities can help installers respond to changing system requirements, resolve configuration issues, and manage system operation without always needing to visit the site.",
